Package: mcstatsim
Type: Package
Title: Monte Carlo Statistical Simulation Tools Using a Functional Approach
Version: 0.9.1
Authors@R: c(person("Imad", "El Badisy", 
      role = c("aut", "cre","cph"),
    email = "elbadisyimad@gmail.com"))
Description:
    A lightweight toolkit for Monte Carlo simulation studies built around a
    higher-order, functional-style interface: the simulation is expressed as a
    function of its parameters and mapped over a grid of conditions by a single
    driver function, which handles iteration, parallelism, reproducible
    per-replication random-number streams, error capture and result assembly.
    Also provides ready-to-use performance measures with Monte Carlo standard
    errors, a summary layer, and diagnostic plots.
